      "filename": "The Ruins (Ancestral home mansion tree).jpg",
      "title": "File:The Ruins (Ancestral home mansion tree).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/The_Ruins_%28Ancestral_home_mansion_tree%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
